<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">Event Confirmation</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">We are delighted to confirm your attendance at the upcoming <strong>Executive Soirée with Flywire and Xetta</strong> event.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><strong>Event Details:</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Date: 22 February 2024</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Time: 18:30 to 22:00 pm</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Location: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.eqkualalumpur.equatorial.com/dining/sabayon/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Sabayon Restaurant at EQ</u></strong></span></a>, Equatorial Plaza, Jln Sultan Ismail, Kuala Lumpur, 50250 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><strong>Tentative Agenda:</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">18:30 - 19:10 - Welcome and Networking Drinks at Terrace</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">19:10 - 19:30 - Opening and Welcome by Flywire and Xetta</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">19:30 - 22:00 - Private 3 - Course Meal Dining</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">The dress code for the event is “smart casual”. Shorts, sleeveless, and/or slippers are not permitted. Please feel free to embrace the occasion while keeping in mind the professional nature of the gathering.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">We are thrilled to have you join us for what promises to be an engaging and productive event. If you have any further questions or require additional information, please don't hesitate to reach out to <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:tania.hurry@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Tania Hurry</u></strong></span></a>.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Looking forward to seeing you there!</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><br />The <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://edu.flywire.com?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire</u></strong></span></a> and <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://xetta.com/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Xetta</u></strong></span></a> Team</p> </td> 
</tr> 
